# Temporary test files (root-anchored: the un-anchored `test*.rs` silently
# skipped crates/auto-lang/src/vm/tests_string_pool.rs at `git add`, leaving
# master with a mod declaration but no file (Plan 417-E3 merge incident);
# subdir test files are all tracked, so anchoring surfaces no new noise)
tmp/
/test*.at
/test*.c
/test*.h
/test*.rs
/test*.sh
/test*.pdb
